{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sainthood: Confessions is a poker-like deck builder about using poker hands to build and chain devastating combos with powerful synergies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/b6c6c3814cfbb8713f67a142c82e52d7.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/b6c6c3814cfbb8713f67a142c82e52d7.webm?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/b6c6c3814cfbb8713f67a142c82e52d7.mp4?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker-like Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build poker hands, bend the rules with saints and relics, and unleash holy combos, but watch out for SIN cards that clog your deck! Find the perfect card synergies to bring absolution to souls with cinematic flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/8cee6b445e63555022236094e6995d69.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/8cee6b445e63555022236094e6995d69.webm?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/8cee6b445e63555022236094e6995d69.mp4?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the saints</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine saints, relics, and blessings for powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/6c18a4c65181f79c33c2f091ee8c2b84.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/6c18a4c65181f79c33c2f091ee8c2b84.webm?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/6c18a4c65181f79c33c2f091ee8c2b84.mp4?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dance with Sin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for<strong>\u00a0SIN cards!</strong>\u200b They are functionally useless and only serve to\u00a0clog your deck over time! You must purge them from your deck before they overwhelm you.\u200b I'm sure there's a real-life analogy here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/6b221badfe59ddfbd6208a029233f9ca.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/6b221badfe59ddfbd6208a029233f9ca.webm?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/6b221badfe59ddfbd6208a029233f9ca.mp4?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against the 7 Deadly Sins that switch up the gameplay in challenging ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/2907bcf9452d5dbc8619bcf27403b5d7.webp?t=1757387473\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/2907bcf9452d5dbc8619bcf27403b5d7.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=170 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folk Horror Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Heart of Darkness</i>,<i>\u00a0</i>and a true story my mother told me, the game unfolds through daily journal entries, encroaching dread, and a deadly final confrontation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the thick jungles of 1885 southern Nigeria, experience a unique narrative told purely through text and sound design.\u00a0You set out with hunters, porters, a scout, cook, catechist, and healer. Each night by the campfire, one steps forward to confess. It's your sacred duty to listen, assign penance, and bring their soul to absolution\u2014or damnation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974320?t=1757387473","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974320?t=1757387473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/b9f09771ae16ee28cc83b6c8d8649fe2d83ee621/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757387473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/b9f09771ae16ee28cc83b6c8d8649fe2d83ee621/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757387473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The end of the story gets a little scary when the priest has to confront a ritualist, but there will only be audio descriptions of the scene, and no graphic images will be displayed."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sainthood: Confessions is a poker-like deck builder about using poker hands to build and chain devastating combos with powerful synergies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/b6c6c3814cfbb8713f67a142c82e52d7.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/b6c6c3814cfbb8713f67a142c82e52d7.webm?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/b6c6c3814cfbb8713f67a142c82e52d7.mp4?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker-like Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build poker hands, bend the rules with saints and relics, and unleash holy combos, but watch out for SIN cards that clog your deck! Find the perfect card synergies to bring absolution to souls with cinematic flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/8cee6b445e63555022236094e6995d69.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/8cee6b445e63555022236094e6995d69.webm?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/extras/8cee6b445e63555022236094e6995d69.mp4?t=1757387473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the saints</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine saints, relics, and blessings for powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http