452d5dbc8619bcf27403b5d7.poster.avif?t=1757387473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=170 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folk Horror Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Heart of Darkness</i>,<i>\u00a0</i>and a true story my mother told me, the game unfolds through daily journal entries, encroaching dread, and a deadly final confrontation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the thick jungles of 1885 southern Nigeria, experience a unique narrative told purely through text and sound design.\u00a0You set out with hunters, porters, a scout, cook, catechist, and healer. Each night by the campfire, one steps forward to confess. It's your sacred duty to listen, assign penance, and bring their soul to absolution\u2014or damnation.</p>","developers":["Bisong Taiwo"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974320/4c5bd061ebe151643878b09d6fdc7d7119f7bcdb/header.jpg?t=1757387473","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974320/1201771574/ed7e9718c80574ffb3e2b1158986f2b74e61f5d2/1756611106/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756613003","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974320/1201771574/ed7e9718c80574ffb3e2b1158986f2b74e61f5d2/1756611106/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756613003","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974320/1201771574/ed7e9718c80574ffb3e2b1158986f2b74e61f5d2/1756611106/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756613003","id":257191275,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191275/movie480.mp4?t=1756613003","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191275/movie_max.mp4?t=1756613003"},"name":"Teaser Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor